1
00:00:01,052 --> 00:00:03,092
海莉 快点儿 你要迟到了
Haley,hurry up! You are gonna be late.

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:04,280
艾丽克斯 你在干嘛
Alex, what are you doing?

3
00:00:04,372 --> 00:00:06,682
我要记录下海莉的第一次"铁链劳役"行为
I need to document Haley's first standard chain gang.

4
00:00:06,682 --> 00:00:07,851
那不是铁链劳役
It's not a chain gang.

5
00:00:07,851 --> 00:00:09,951
那是社区服务 别烦她了
It's community service. And leave her a lone.

6
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,460
她心情已经够糟糕的了
She feels bad enough as it is.

7
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,520
我快精神分裂了 一方面 我一想到
Okay, I'm torn. On one hand, I'm like,

8
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,980
我得捡一整天垃圾 好烦
"Ugh, I have to pick up garbage all day."

9
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,440
但是另一方面 我又想着
And on the other hand, I'm like,

10
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:17,860
我穿这身橘红色真好看
"Look at me in orange."

11
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:22,160
真漂亮 发给我
Aw, that's cute. Send that to me.

12
00:00:22,329 --> 00:00:25,219
海莉在学校里犯了点法
Haley had a little run-in with the law in college.

13
00:00:25,219 --> 00:00:27,978
她因袭警被捕
She was arrested for assaulting a police officer.

14
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,180
纯属意外 我摔在他身上
Accidentally. I fell on him.

15
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:31,840
当时正因为低龄饮酒而逃避逮捕
While evading arrest for underage drinking.

16
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:33,100
那个是故意的
That was on purpose.

17
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:34,500
他们对她宽大处理
They were very lenient with her.

18
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:35,980
现在她只需做一些社区服务
She only has to do community service.

19
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:38,200
因为本小姐没有前科哦
Because I do not have any priors.

20
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:40,240
你对此有点太得瑟了 宝贝女儿
Taking a little too much pride in that, sweetheart.

21
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:43,100
外面的世界非常危险
Things can get pretty rough out there.

22
00:00:43,276 --> 00:00:45,336
我实在弄不到香烟
I couldn't get my hands on any cigarettes.

23
00:00:45,336 --> 00:00:47,865
但我用一把旧小刀做成了一把尖刀
But I did make you a shiv out of an old knife.

24
00:00:47,865 --> 00:00:49,475
你不可能用一把小刀做成一把尖刀
You don't make a shiv out of a knife.

25
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:52,360
是啊 你可以用锈汤匙或者玻璃碎片做成尖刀
Yeah, you make a shiv out of a rusty spoon or a shard of glass.

26
00:00:52,585 --> 00:00:53,694
或者是人的股骨
Or a human femur.

27
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:55,180
没错 时刻保持创意
Exactly. Be creative.

28
00:00:55,544 --> 00:00:56,764
你真贴心 卢克
It's really sweet of you, Luke,

29
00:00:56,764 --> 00:00:58,484
不过那里都是些酒驾司机和
But there's just gonna be a bunch of drunk drivers

30
00:00:58,484 --> 00:01:00,943
蠢到会被抓现行的"破坏者"而已
and vandalizers who were stupid enough to get caught.

31
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,980
或者蠢到说"破坏者"的人
Or stupid enough to use the word "Vandalizers."

32
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:06,240
应该说"破坏分子"
It's vandals.

33
00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:09,400
众人皆蠢我独聪
I'm so alone.

34
00:01:11,282 --> 00:01:13,221
他们会生吃了你 乡巴佬们
They're gonna eat you alive, suburbia.

35
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:30,160
米奇尔 我们回来了
Mitchell, we're back.

36
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:31,880
你肯定会觉得难以置信
You are not going to believe this.

37
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:33,460
小卡 还记得我为什么不让你
Cam, do you remember why I didn't want you

38
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:35,040
把莉莉衣柜的把手拆掉吗
to swap out the handles on Lily's dresser?

39
00:01:35,058 --> 00:01:37,158
因为你缺乏设计者的眼光 而且害怕改变
Because you lack a designer's eye and fear change?

40
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:39,480
不 是因为我担心两星期之后
No. Because I was afraid two weeks would go by,

41
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:40,660
我们还在用小铲子
and we'd still be using a spatula

42
00:01:40,660 --> 00:01:41,840
来拿莉莉的衣服
to get at Lily's clothes.

43
00:01:42,420 --> 00:01:44,260
好吧 现在有个更严重的问题
Okay, well, we have bigger issues.

44
00:01:44,660 --> 00:01:46,940
猜猜他们今天在公园里砍掉了什么
Guess what they are cutting down at the park today?

45
00:01:47,020 --> 00:01:48,740
-树吗 -对 你怎么知道
- A tree? - Yes. How did you know that?

46
00:01:48,780 --> 00:01:49,560
我"预感"超准
I played a hunch.

47
00:01:49,776 --> 00:01:52,325
不是普通的树 而是那棵"欧娜树"
Not just any tree, Tree-ona elmsly.

48
00:01:52,440 --> 00:01:55,140
不是吧 太糟了 那可是我们野餐专用树啊
Oh, no. That's terrible. That's our picnic tree.

49
00:01:55,140 --> 00:01:56,980
简直是噩梦
It's a nightmare.

50
00:01:57,620 --> 00:01:59,440
小姑娘遗传了她老爸爱夸张的毛病哦
Well, someone's picked up her daddy's gift for hyperbole.

51
00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:01,660
他们要锯掉一片天堂
They are literally chainsawing paradise

52
00:02:01,694 --> 00:02:03,894
-来建一座停车场 -太糟糕了
- to put up a parking lot. - Oh, it's too bad.

53
00:02:03,894 --> 00:02:04,814
我们得采取点措施
We have to do something.

54
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:06,100
如果我们早点知道 是可以
Well, if we knew earlier, we could.

55
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:08,100
我很自责 我揽了太多事
I blame myself. I've taken on too much.

56
00:02:09,380 --> 00:02:10,640
你揽了哪些事来着
What exactly have you taken on?

57
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:12,700
你开什么玩笑 上音乐课
Are you kidding me? Teaching music?

58
00:02:12,780 --> 00:02:15,420
拆掉这个把手 出演音乐剧
This dresser handle project? My role in the musical?

59
00:02:15,620 --> 00:02:16,580
哎呀那个噢
Oh, that.

60
00:02:16,740 --> 00:02:18,060
知道吗 我不喜欢你的语气
You know what? I don't like your tone.

61
00:02:18,181 --> 00:02:21,301
替角儿在任何演出中都最具挑战性
The understudy's the most challenging role in any production.

62
00:02:21,301 --> 00:02:22,831
你必须时刻准备上场
You have to be ready at a moment's notice

63
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,700
去面对一群失望的观众
to go on and face a disappointed audience

64
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:26,440
他们本来是想看肯尼·范·海辛顿的
who was there to see Kenny Van Heffington.

65
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:27,760
那个卖保险的吗
Our insurance guy?

66
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:28,700
他的表演激动人心
He's breathtaking.

67
00:02:29,140 --> 00:02:30,800
-是吗 -好吧 我恨他
- Really? - Yeah, I hate him.

68
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,340
无所谓了 我刚刚在说什么
Anyway, what was I talking about?

69
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:34,180
给衣柜装上新把手
Putting new handles on the dresser.

70
00:02:34,660 --> 00:02:36,700
对了 树的问题 我得采取点措施
Right. The tree. I have to do something.

71
00:02:38,820 --> 00:02:41,100
这样的日子我过不下去了
I can't live like this.

72
00:02:45,580 --> 00:02:47,440
曼尼 你再磨蹭我们就老了
Manny, while we're young!

73
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:48,440
他不想去
He doesn't want to go.

74
00:02:48,740 --> 00:02:50,660
所以他才精心打扮了这么长时间
That's why he's taking so long with the primping.

75
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:53,700
像他这么大的男孩子根本不该打扮
A boy his age should do exactly zero primping.

76
00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:54,820
你准备好了吗
You ready?

77
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:55,900
完全没有
Not in the least.

78
00:02:56,060 --> 00:02:56,980
就该这样
That's the spirit.

79
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:59,220
我班上有个同学 道格·布鲁克斯
This kid in my class, Doug Brooks,

80
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:01,800
每年都要举办运动主题的生日派对
has a sports-themed birthday party every year.

81
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:04,480
全是男生 全是运动 全天不停
All boys. All sports. All day.

82
00:03:04,974 --> 00:03:06,814
他称之为"道林匹克"
He calls it the Doug-lympics,

83
00:03:06,860 --> 00:03:09,200
可那也得他每4年举办一次
which might make sense if he did it every four years,

84
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:10,820
或者他名叫"奥"才说得通啊
or if his name was Al.

85
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:13,200
我只能说 一切都是狗屁不通
Let's just say nothing about it works.

86
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:15,980
曼尼 今天天气很好
Manny, it's a beautiful day outside.

87
00:03:16,123 --> 00:03:18,082
去吧 享受你的道林匹克
Go on. Enjoy your Dougy-lympics.

88
00:03:18,100 --> 00:03:20,700
你不用非得赢奖牌 找点儿乐子就行
You don't have to win a medal. Just have fun.

89
00:03:20,820 --> 00:03:23,020
无论如何道格总会赢得最多的奖牌
Doug finishes with the most medals no matter what.

90
00:03:23,020 --> 00:03:24,840
而且我觉得他邀请我
Plus I think he only invites me

91
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,720
只是因为他喜欢将肤色与国家联系起来
because he likes to match skin color to nation.

92
00:03:27,091 --> 00:03:28,871
艾伦·严就是因此才会被邀请的
I know that's why Alan Yan gets invited.

93
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,680
我们明白的 运动不是你的强项
Okay, we get it. Sports isn't your thing.

94
00:03:30,820 --> 00:03:33,760
但你有时候得走出自己的"舒适小世界"
But you gotta step out of your comfort zone sometime.

95
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:35,560
看在老天爷的份上
And for god sake,

96
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:36,780
把这双尖头鞋换了吧
change out of those wingtips.

97
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:38,960
你还是个小孩子 不是沙滩上的尼克松
You're a kid. You're not Nixon on the beach.

98
00:03:39,340 --> 00:03:40,920
好吧 我去换"运动专用鞋"
Fine. I'll put on my sporty shoes.

99
00:03:41,340 --> 00:03:42,000
在哪儿来着
Where are they?

100
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,200
在鞋盒里尚未拆封
They're still in the box.

101
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,940
别忘了在你穿鞋子之前
And don't forget to take out the paper

102
00:03:44,940 --> 00:03:46,380
把塞在里头的纸拿出来 好吗
before you put them on, okay?

103
00:03:46,580 --> 00:03:48,260
而且那就叫运动鞋
And they're called sneakers.

104
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:53,060
大家好啊
Hello, hello!

105
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,660
歌洛莉亚 准备好出发了吗
Hey, Gloria. So, ready to go?

106
00:03:56,216 --> 00:03:58,326
-去哪儿 -不是说好了去逛好市多吗
- Where? - Thought we were doing a Costco run.

107
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,820
我明白了
Oh, I see what this is.

108
00:04:01,140 --> 00:04:03,920
你打电话叫克莱尔来照顾我这个傻瓜孕妇
You called Claire to babysit the stupid pregnant lady!

109
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,680
是你打电话给她的
You're the one who called her.

110
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:06,660
我有吗
I did?

111
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,220
我打给克莱尔的
I called Claire.

112
00:04:08,780 --> 00:04:09,920
得有人看着歌洛莉亚
Gloria needs watching.

113
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:12,580
她的孕期健忘症很严重
She's got a serious case of pregnancy brain.

114
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:15,460
上周我在冰箱里找到一块肥皂
Last week, I found a bar of soap in the fridge

115
00:04:15,460 --> 00:04:17,340
在浴室看到一块黄油
and a stick of butter in the shower.

116
00:04:17,340 --> 00:04:20,560
我洗完一整天浑身都是爆米花般的黄油味
I walked around all day smelling like a bucket of popcorn.

117
00:04:21,180 --> 00:04:22,620
总比我吃的"肥皂吐司"强
Better than the toast I ate.

118
00:04:23,340 --> 00:04:25,160
那你还吃了两块
Yet you ate the second piece.

119
00:04:25,922 --> 00:04:28,841
杰 拜拜了 我们走了
Jay! Bye-bye! We're leaving!

120
00:04:28,841 --> 00:04:30,591
不是吧你 我就站在这呢
Seriously? I'm right here.

121
00:04:36,690 --> 00:04:39,600
下蹲 下蹲 揍他 你个小怪胎
Duck! Duck! Come on and hit him, you little freak!

122
00:04:40,420 --> 00:04:42,340
那也敢号称是左勾拳
Talk about a big left hook.

123
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,620
天呐 我爱你
God, I love you.

124
00:04:43,939 --> 00:04:44,819
菲尔填空
Phil in the blank!

125
00:04:44,819 --> 00:04:46,049
比尔法案
Bill of rights!

126
00:04:46,049 --> 00:04:47,469
老杰瑞
Jerry-atric!

127
00:04:47,879 --> 00:04:49,738
艾伦他爹
Alan's dad!

128
00:04:49,748 --> 00:04:51,568
伙计们 卢克 你准备好了吗
Hey, guys. Luke, you getting in there?

129
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,200
当然
Of course.

130
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:55,280
看呐 又让我代表墨西哥队
Look, I'm Mexico. Again.

131
00:04:55,820 --> 00:04:57,660
到底有没有人在乎 我不是墨西哥来的
Does anybody care that I'm not from mexico?

132
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,060
你总那么说
You keep saying that,

133
00:04:59,060 --> 00:05:00,600
不过我们谁也没看过你的出生证明
but we've never seen a birth certificate.

134
00:05:00,767 --> 00:05:02,406
好了 我5点钟会过来接你
All right, look, I'll pick you up at 5:00.

135
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,440
玩得"昏"天暗地吧
Knock yourself out.

136
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:05,680
或者更好的 拳击场上把别人打"昏"吧
Or better still, knock someone else out.

137
00:05:06,016 --> 00:05:06,776
杰 你要去哪儿
Jay, where you headed?

138
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:08,500
你不如就在这里和其他当爹的喝杯啤酒吧
Why don't you stick around and grab a beer with the dads?

139
00:05:08,595 --> 00:05:09,855
我都不认识这些人
Oh, I don't really know those guys.

140
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:11,680
我想我还是去趟俱乐部 打打球吧
I think I'll just swing by the club, hit a few balls.

141
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:13,880
来吧 我介绍你跟他们认识
Well, come here. Let me introduce you around.

142
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:14,540
嘿 伙计们
Hey, guys,

143
00:05:15,140 --> 00:05:17,380
这位是杰 我的岳父 曼尼的后爹
This is Jay, my father-in-law. Manny's stepdad.

144
00:05:17,414 --> 00:05:18,694
你好吗 "杰冻"
Hey, what's up, Jay-lo?

145
00:05:18,740 --> 00:05:20,000
够了伙计们 失陪了
Okay, guys, I'll see you later.

146
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,460
怎么了 杰
What's the matter, Jay?

147
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:23,400
不敢踏出自己的"舒适小世界"吗
Afraid to step outside your comfort zone?

148
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,280
我要把你遣返墨西哥
I will send you back to Mexico.

149
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,700
其实不是我叫你过来的 对吧
I didn't really call you, did I?

150
00:05:29,140 --> 00:05:31,060
对 是我爸 不过我还以为你知道呢
No, my dad did. But I thought you knew.

151
00:05:31,982 --> 00:05:33,632
我想对他大发雷霆
Ugh. I want to be so mad at him,

152
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:34,880
可他是对的
but he's right.

153
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:36,980
我现在身上有两个脑袋
I have two brains in my body,

154
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:38,260
却史无前例得傻
but I've never been so dumb.

155
00:05:38,380 --> 00:05:39,580
正常 我理解你
It happens. I get it.

156
00:05:39,580 --> 00:05:41,620
你身体里还有另外一个人
You have another human being inside of you,

157
00:05:41,620 --> 00:05:42,800
跟你争夺营养
competing for resources.

158
00:05:43,070 --> 00:05:44,660
当年我怀艾丽克斯的时候
Look, when I was pregnant with Alex,

159
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,880
我连自己叫什么都记不住
I could barely remember my name.

160
00:05:46,140 --> 00:05:47,580
怀海莉和卢克的时候也这样吗
Same with Haley and Luke?

161
00:05:47,749 --> 00:05:48,899
没那么严重
Mm, not so much.

162
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:50,660
他们好像就在里面闲着似的 随便我做什么
They kind of just hung out in there, let me do my thing.

163
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:52,720
谢谢你理解我
Thank you for understanding.

164
00:05:53,340 --> 00:05:54,480
你过来我真高兴
I'm glad that you came.

165
00:05:55,220 --> 00:05:57,260
有助于避免我忘了什么事儿
It will help me not to forget stuff.

166
00:05:57,338 --> 00:05:59,368
我也很高兴能帮上忙 我...
I'm glad I can help out. I--

167
00:06:00,177 --> 00:06:02,087
你为什么不先停车
Why didn't you stop first?!

168
00:06:04,100 --> 00:06:04,900
大爸在哪儿
Where's daddy?

169
00:06:05,097 --> 00:06:06,047
我不知道 亲爱的
I don't know, sweetie.

170
00:06:06,047 --> 00:06:07,496
他告诉我在欧娜树那里见
He said to meet him by Tree-ona.

171
00:06:07,620 --> 00:06:08,580
米奇尔 莉莉
Mitchell! Lily!

172
00:06:08,580 --> 00:06:09,540
他在哪儿
Where is he?

173
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,120
上面 往上看
Up here! Look up here!

174
00:06:11,526 --> 00:06:13,475
小卡 你在上面干嘛
Cam, what are you doing up there?

175
00:06:13,475 --> 00:06:15,075
我本来想过来和这棵树道别
I came down to say good bye to the tree,

176
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,180
给它最后一个拥抱
give it one final hug,

177
00:06:16,180 --> 00:06:18,040
不知道怎么 就上来了
and before I knew it, I was up here.

178
00:06:18,220 --> 00:06:19,760
你刚说"最后一个拥抱"其实是...
When you say "One final hug"...

179
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:22,480
要是我占住这棵树 他们就不会砍它了
If I'm occupying the tree, they can't cut it down.

180
00:06:22,700 --> 00:06:24,000
我谷歌了一下 是真的
I googled it. It's a thing.

181
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:26,000
莉莉 你看 这就是个噩梦
Okay, Lily, see, this is a nightmare.

182
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:28,000
那还用你说
Tell me about it.

183
00:06:28,660 --> 00:06:31,380
说实话 你喜欢列好要做的事 提前规划
You know what? You're a list-maker, a planner.

184
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:34,220
我是践行者和实干家
I'm a doer and an action taker!

185
00:06:34,820 --> 00:06:36,880
如果他们拍这种电影 会找西恩·潘演我
Sean Penn would play me in a movie about this,

186
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:39,580
如果他们想拍女性题材的 会找安妮·海瑟薇
or Anne Hathaway, if they wanted a female-driven vehicle.

187
00:06:39,651 --> 00:06:41,531
那会找谁扮演你饱受折磨的伴侣呢
And who would play your long-suffering partner?

188
00:06:41,531 --> 00:06:42,921
朱莉安·摩尔 两种都是她
Julianne Moore, either way.

189
00:06:42,921 --> 00:06:44,711
我能看出来 我能 我知道
I would totally see that. I would.

190
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:47,080
你好 我领导想知道
Hey! My supervisor wants to know

191
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:48,800
你有没有精神病史
if you have a history of mental illness.

192
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,040
没有 先生 我没有
No, sir, I do not.

193
00:06:55,859 --> 00:06:57,379
好了 小卡 说来听听 有什么计划
All right, Cam, let's hear. What's the plan?

194
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:59,620
我不知道 我是走一步看一步
I don't know. I'm sort of making it up as I go.

195
00:06:59,858 --> 00:07:01,328
你确定你想要这么做
Are you sure you wanna do this?

196
00:07:01,328 --> 00:07:04,228
我这辈子从来没对什么事这么确定过
Yes. I've never been more sure about anything in my life.

197
00:07:04,228 --> 00:07:07,697
我们得教会女儿树立坚定立场的价值
We need to teach our daughter the value of taking a stand,

198
00:07:07,697 --> 00:07:09,657
无论付出什么代价
no matter the sacrifice!

199
00:07:11,180 --> 00:07:11,660
喂
Hello?

200
00:07:14,020 --> 00:07:16,340
好的 我立刻就来
Done. I'll be right there .

201
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,380
米奇尔 你得上树来 我得走了
Mitchell, you need to get up here. I have to go.

202
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:19,220
什么
Excuse me?

203
00:07:19,345 --> 00:07:20,805
是我们歌剧团打来的 有个演员病了
That was my theater troupe. An actor's sick.

204
00:07:20,815 --> 00:07:22,025
我得过去 顶一场日场演出
I have to go and do the matinee.

205
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:24,380
不是说要教莉莉树立坚定的立场吗
What happened to showing Lily the value of taking a stand?

206
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,700
那可是个主角
It's the lead.

207
00:07:25,980 --> 00:07:28,160
向她展现一个人信守承诺
It's also important to show her the value

208
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,660
也是非常重要的
of honoring one's commitments.

209
00:07:29,780 --> 00:07:32,340
这种情况下 我的承诺优先于我的立场
And in this case, my commitment preceded my stand!

210
00:07:32,423 --> 00:07:33,963
真是你的一贯作风 小卡
This is so you, Cam.

211
00:07:33,980 --> 00:07:36,640
你发起一件事 却总指望我替你收场
You start something, and then you expect me to finish it.

212
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:37,620
所以你是不会上来的是吗
So you're not coming up here?

213
00:07:37,700 --> 00:07:39,660
不 我才不 走吧
No! No, I'm not. Come on.

214
00:07:40,140 --> 00:07:40,580
米奇尔
Mitchell?

215
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:43,540
莉莉第一次翻身那天我们在哪儿
Where were we the first day Lily rolled over?

216
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:44,760
在这棵树下
Under this tree.

217
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:47,280
我们第一次玩藏猫猫的大本部在哪儿
Where is home base when we play hide-and-go-seek?

218
00:07:47,780 --> 00:07:48,600
在这棵树下
Under this tree.

219
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:49,960
还有 在危险的暴雨闪电中
And where did we take shelter

220
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:51,640
我们的避难所在哪儿
during that dangerous lightning storm?

221
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,860
虽然那不是个好主意 不过是在这棵树下
Wasn't a good idea, but it was under this tree.

222
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:57,820
爹地 你一定要救救这棵树
Daddy, you've got to save the tree!

223
00:07:57,980 --> 00:07:59,940
是啊 爹地 你得救救这棵树
Yeah, daddy, you have to save the tree!

224
00:07:59,940 --> 00:08:00,520
行 好吧
Okay, okay.

225
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:02,800
但你完事以后立马给我回来
But you get back here the second you are done.

226
00:08:02,980 --> 00:08:05,200
我不擅长拒绝那些冲到后台求签名的粉丝
Well, I can't very well turn away fans that come backstage.

227
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:05,860
立马回来
The second!

228
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:18,140
去年夏天 我姐拍了一张我的大糗照
Last summer, my sister took a totally humiliating photo of me.

229
00:08:21,066 --> 00:08:22,706
海莉 这不好笑
Haley, that's not funny!

230
00:08:22,706 --> 00:08:24,185
她把照片发到了Facebook上
Then she posted it to Facebook

231
00:08:24,185 --> 00:08:25,845
并且拒绝删掉
and refused to take it down.

232
00:08:26,060 --> 00:08:27,900
有873个人赞
It got 873 likes.

233
00:08:28,555 --> 00:08:31,654
与此同时 我却一张海莉的糗照都没有
Meanwhile, there's not one embarrassing photo of Haley.

234
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,660
连她的犯罪照都很漂亮
Even her mug shots were cute.

235
00:08:36,100 --> 00:08:37,880
今天 我要报仇雪恨
Today, I get my revenge.

236
00:08:38,503 --> 00:08:40,393
拍一张海莉脏兮兮 汗淋淋
One photo of Haley, dirty, sweaty,

237
00:08:40,540 --> 00:08:41,820
像罪犯一样捡垃圾的照片
picking up trash like a criminal.

238
00:08:42,580 --> 00:08:44,020
那会成为我最得意的时刻
It'll be my finest moment.

239
00:08:45,060 --> 00:08:46,740
我希望自己能在近几年内多交些朋友
In a few years, I hope to have some more friends

240
00:08:46,740 --> 00:08:48,100
别再闲到干这种事的地步
and not have time for this kind of stuff.

241
00:08:52,500 --> 00:08:53,380
我回来了
Okay. Hey.

242
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,440
你去哪了
Where did you go?

243
00:08:54,540 --> 00:08:55,300
去拿了件运动衫
To get a sweatshirt.

244
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:57,700
我们已经在速冻食品区站了半个小时了
We've been standing in the frozen food aisle for half an hour.

245
00:08:58,140 --> 00:08:59,020
我要买速冻食品
I need something frozen.

246
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:00,780
好 买哪个
Right. What?

247
00:09:01,340 --> 00:09:04,260
不知道 我只写了一个"冻"字
I don't know. I just wrote the word "frozen."

248
00:09:04,460 --> 00:09:06,000
好吧 好好想想
Okay. Uh, let's think.

249
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:08,240
豌豆 冰激凌 冻比萨饼还是华夫饼
Peas. Ice cream. Pizza. Waffles.

250
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:08,960
等一下
Wait a minute.

251
00:09:09,948 --> 00:09:12,108
我写的是"打"字 我要买的是鸡蛋
It says "dozen." I need the eggs!

252
00:09:12,220 --> 00:09:14,120
是鸡蛋啊 好
Ah, the eggs. Okay.

253
00:09:14,188 --> 00:09:15,718
不对 在另一边
Ay, no, on the other side.

254
00:09:16,087 --> 00:09:17,837
老天 我 我来推车
Oh, god. I-I'll get the carts.

255
00:09:17,847 --> 00:09:20,067
真是... 抱歉
So that's... Oh, sorry.

256
00:09:20,067 --> 00:09:22,836
那辆也是我的 是我的 我抓住了
That's... That's me. That's me. I got it.

257
00:09:25,406 --> 00:09:27,046
加把劲 伙计们 我们快顶不住了
Come on, guys! You're killing us!

258
00:09:27,060 --> 00:09:28,300
墨西哥小子跑哪去了
Where the heck is Mexico?

259
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:30,980
好消息 先生们 我又找到一根绳子
Good news, gentlemen! I found another rope.

260
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:32,860
我们可以玩跳双绳 大家双赢多好
If we double-dutch, everyone wins.

261
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,960
好 别动
Okay, hold still...

262
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:37,800
等一下
And wait for it...

263
00:09:37,900 --> 00:09:39,880
来瞧瞧你发胖加秃顶以后的样子
This is what you'd look like fat and bald.

264
00:09:42,023 --> 00:09:43,933
我自拍一张 不装那个应用也是这样的效果
On my phone, that app's called a camera.

265
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:45,580
比尔 别这么妄自菲薄
Bill, don't do that to yourself.

266
00:09:45,660 --> 00:09:48,160
告诉你吧 艾琳是个幸运的女人
Let me tell you something. Ellen is one lucky woman.

267
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:50,660
这有什么好笑的
Why is that funny?

268
00:09:50,660 --> 00:09:52,080
因为她老公是杰瑞而不是比尔
Because she's married to Jerry.

269
00:09:53,980 --> 00:09:55,060
杰 你手机里有什么好玩的应用
Jay, you got any good apps?

270
00:09:55,611 --> 00:09:57,681
不知道 我有呼叫等待功能 那算吗
I don't know. I got call waiting. Is that an app?

271
00:09:58,660 --> 00:10:00,300
你们很爱笑 是吧
You guys laugh a lot, huh?

272
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:02,300
杰对电子产品不太在行
Jay's a little technologically challenged.

273
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:04,160
你个不会开手动挡车的人还敢说我
From a guy who can't drive a stick.

274
00:10:04,210 --> 00:10:05,120
-什么 -你真不会吗
- What? - You can't?

275
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:07,270
有一次他打电话叫我去营救他
Well... he called me to rescue him one time.

276
00:10:07,270 --> 00:10:09,879
他停在一个坡上 不敢松离合器
He got stuck on a hill. He was afraid to let go of the clutch.

277
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,780
我赶到的时候
By the time I got there,

278
00:10:11,780 --> 00:10:13,340
他后面排了半英里长的车队
traffic's backed up half a mile,

279
00:10:13,580 --> 00:10:15,420
所有人都在冲他嚷嚷 他急得直哭
everybody's yelling at him. He's in tears.

280
00:10:15,708 --> 00:10:17,538
我没哭 是出的汗
Not tears. Maybe sweat.

281
00:10:17,538 --> 00:10:19,088
是 他眼睛出了汗
Yeah, sweatin' out your eyes.

282
00:10:25,397 --> 00:10:27,926
我拍到了差不多10张海莉的糗照
I had about ten pretty bad pictures of Haley.

283
00:10:27,926 --> 00:10:29,186
我本可以就此收手
I could have quit right there,

284
00:10:29,186 --> 00:10:30,916
但我是个完美主义者
but I'm a perfectionist.

285
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:31,600
我琢磨着
I thought,

286
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:34,620
"我能做得更好 我会拍到更难看的"
"I could do better. She could look worse."

287
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,420
天呐
Oh, my god.

288
00:10:42,860 --> 00:10:43,780
行了 哥们
All right, pal.

289
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,260
从树上下来吧
Come down from the tree.

290
00:10:45,260 --> 00:10:46,880
抱歉 我做不到
Sorry, can't do that.

291
00:10:47,540 --> 00:10:49,060
再不下来我们就把你拽下来
Come down before we pull you down.

292
00:10:49,203 --> 00:10:51,233
淡定 别动粗
W--hey. Ease up.

293
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:51,900
有什么问题
What's the problem?

294
00:10:52,060 --> 00:10:53,460
听着 我也不想呆在树上
Look, I don't want to be up here.

295
00:10:53,700 --> 00:10:55,900
懂吗 但这是我女儿最心爱的一棵树
You know? But this is my daughter's favorite tree.

296
00:10:56,020 --> 00:10:57,520
我家男人 他也竭力反对
And my partner-- he's all up in arms

297
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:59,040
他们把树砍掉 所以...
about them cutting it down, so...

298
00:10:59,040 --> 00:11:00,900
你男人既然那么热衷 他为什么没来
Well, if your partner's so worked up, why isn't he here?

299
00:11:01,180 --> 00:11:02,860
你这问题问得真好
Oh, well, that's a very good question.

300
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:05,420
那是因为他习惯了做事有始无终
It's because he starts things, and he doesn't finish them,

301
00:11:05,420 --> 00:11:06,280
所以我就要替他收场
so then I have to.

302
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,440
跟我老婆一模一样
Just like my wife.

303
00:11:07,790 --> 00:11:10,580
我的心理医生会说我们这样是在纵容他们
You know, my therapist would say we're "enabling" them.

304
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,760
又是你的心理医生
You and your therapist.

305
00:11:12,340 --> 00:11:14,200
要不是你枪击了那家伙 我也不用去看心理医生啊
I wouldn't have to see him if you hadn't shot that guy.

306
00:11:14,489 --> 00:11:15,539
不是吧 又来
Aw, that again?

307
00:11:16,060 --> 00:11:17,500
我们用消防水管把他喷下来得了
Look, let's just spray him with the fire hose.

308
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,500
你只会越帮越忙 泰瑞
You're not helping, Terry.

309
00:11:19,460 --> 00:11:21,380
那不是你的"战斗"
It's not your fight.

310
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,880
所以你何不给我们个面子
So why don't you do us a favor,

311
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:23,860
从树上下来吧
and come on down?

312
00:11:23,980 --> 00:11:25,960
因为他是对的 懂吗
Because he's right, all right?

313
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:27,080
那是最让我无奈的
That's the frustrating part.

314
00:11:27,127 --> 00:11:29,687
我在这上面坐了几个小时了
I-I've been sitting up here these past few hours,

315
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:32,680
而且 这棵树很漂亮 好吗
and... this tree is beautiful, okay?

316
00:11:32,717 --> 00:11:36,536
我能听到小松鼠们在树枝间穿梭的声音
And I-I can hear the squirrels dancing through the branches,

317
00:11:36,536 --> 00:11:37,996
他们追逐嬉戏
you know, chasing each other,

318
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:39,380
全然不知这乐园要被摧毁了
no idea what's about to happen.

319
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:40,920
你知道吗 这不只是一棵树
You know, this isn't just a tree.

320
00:11:41,660 --> 00:11:42,740
而是一个家园
This is a home.

321
00:11:43,220 --> 00:11:45,140
没错 一大家子老鼠的家园
Yeah, to, like, a hundred rats.

322
00:11:45,380 --> 00:11:46,760
树上到处都是老鼠
They're all over this thing.

323
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,140
你说什么都没有用
Well, that changes nothing.

324
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:50,500
要是有必要 我会在这跟你们耗一晚上
I will wait you guys out all night if I have to.

325
00:11:51,040 --> 00:11:51,800
小卡 给你20分钟
Cam, you got 20 minutes,

326
00:11:51,800 --> 00:11:52,700
再不回来我就下去了
and I'm out of this tree.

327
00:11:54,473 --> 00:11:56,143
泰瑞 去把消防水管准备好吧
Terry, you wanna get ready with that hose?

328
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,820
有一天艾丽克斯放学回来
So Alex comes home from school the other day,

329
00:11:58,913 --> 00:12:00,942
跟我说她老师听不懂她说的话
and she said the teacher didn't know what she was talking about,

330
00:12:00,942 --> 00:12:02,092
但实际上 我不觉得...
when in reality, I don't think that--

331
00:12:04,780 --> 00:12:05,880
你差点把我的头砍下来
You almost just cut my head off.

332
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:06,740
你得注意点
You gotta focus.

333
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:10,080
对不起 到头来 我还是忘了买鸡蛋
I am sorry. After all that, I forgot the eggs!

334
00:12:10,091 --> 00:12:11,851
-打扰一下 -你等会儿
- Excuse me. - Yeah, hang on one second.

335
00:12:11,980 --> 00:12:14,100
听我说 你犯傻不只是因为怀孕
Listen, this is not just your pregnancy.

336
00:12:14,220 --> 00:12:15,680
你这是故意让你的大脑停工
You are purposely turning your brain off.

337
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:17,640
你至少得有意识地稍微注意一点
You have to at least try to pay attention.

338
00:12:17,690 --> 00:12:18,540
-女士 -怎么
- Ma'am? - Yeah.

339
00:12:18,540 --> 00:12:19,989
你有这件运动衫的收据吗
Do you have a receipt for that sweatshirt?

340
00:12:20,020 --> 00:12:20,800
糟糕
Oh, shoot.

341
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:22,680
你得跟我回商场一趟
I'm gonna need you to come back into the store.

342
00:12:22,759 --> 00:12:24,559
不 不 我只是忘了我还穿着它了
Oh, no. No, it's--I forgot I was wearing it.

343
00:12:24,620 --> 00:12:25,200
没什么要紧的 给你
It's no big deal. Here.

344
00:12:25,218 --> 00:12:26,978
女士 跟我回商场
Ma'am. The store.

345
00:12:27,060 --> 00:12:28,120
别开玩笑了
Are you kidding me?

346
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,740
我真没想偷这运动衫
I didn't try to steal a sweatshirt!

347
00:12:29,920 --> 00:12:31,100
先生 我可是位母亲
Sir, I'm a mom.

348
00:12:31,760 --> 00:12:32,640
歌洛莉亚 帮帮我
Gloria, help me out.

349
00:12:32,740 --> 00:12:34,120
听好了 警察先生
Listen, Mr. Policeman,

350
00:12:34,260 --> 00:12:35,780
我们真要偷
If we wanted to steal it,

351
00:12:35,780 --> 00:12:37,580
你压根不可能发觉它不见了
You wouldn't even know that it was gone!

352
00:12:37,820 --> 00:12:38,800
行了 你这是帮倒忙
Yeah, okay. That's not helping.

353
00:12:52,660 --> 00:12:57,660
天呐 一只金手镯
Oh, my god! A gold bracelet!

354
00:12:57,740 --> 00:12:59,320
捡到的东西能归我们吗
Hey, can we keep what we find?

355
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:01,560
无语了
Unbelievable.

356
00:13:06,020 --> 00:13:06,500
不是吧
Really?

357
00:13:11,371 --> 00:13:12,811
先生们 你们想知道
Gentlemen, you wanna know about

358
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:13,920
什么是真正的飞盘比赛吗
the real ultimate frisbee?

359
00:13:14,231 --> 00:13:16,591
头顶着飞盘走50米不让它掉下来
Walk with one balanced on your head for 50 meters.

360
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:19,220
它需要你的姿势 平衡和体态
It is a measure of poise, balance, and posture.

361
00:13:19,330 --> 00:13:21,920
我们就尽可能用力地相互扔飞盘吧
Let's just whip the frisbees at each other as hard as we can

362
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:23,230
看谁第一个退出
and see who quits first.

363
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:24,340
飞盘大战
Frisbee smash.

364
00:13:25,060 --> 00:13:26,340
酷毙了 开始吧
Awesome! Let's go!

365
00:13:26,700 --> 00:13:27,940
天呐 我苦命得和西西弗似的
Oh, my god, I'm Sisyphus.

366
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,240
大苦逼
A big one!

367
00:13:30,998 --> 00:13:33,858
他当时在我家院子 提了个录放机
So he's out in our yard and he's got a boombox...

368
00:13:34,218 --> 00:13:35,998
那个提录放机情节的电影叫什么来着
What's the name of that movie with the boombox?

369
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:37,660
-《情到深处》 -约翰·马奥尼演的
- Oh, "Say anything." - With John Mahoney.

370
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:39,420
总之 他就站在那儿
So anyway, he's out there,

371
00:13:39,420 --> 00:13:41,340
恳请克莱尔原谅他
And he's begging Claire for forgiveness.

372
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:44,040
但她还在气头上 完全听不进去
She's still mad at him. She won't have any of it.

373
00:13:44,140 --> 00:13:46,200
然后他把音量开到最大
So he turns it up full-blast,

374
00:13:46,626 --> 00:13:48,606
放的竟然是奥莉维亚·纽顿-约翰的歌
And it's Olivia Newton-John.

375
00:13:49,676 --> 00:13:52,885
他就开始唱《让我们一起"菲动"》
And he starts singing, "Let's get Phil-sical"!

376
00:13:53,520 --> 00:13:55,220
那是个小范围的内部笑话
It was an inside joke.

377
00:13:55,485 --> 00:13:57,024
不再是喽
Well, not anymore!

378
00:13:57,474 --> 00:13:59,124
行啦 开心果菲尔的故事就到此为止吧
Okay, enough with the funny Phil stories.

379
00:13:59,124 --> 00:14:00,614
别啊 我还没说到最精彩的地方呢
No, but I haven't even gotten to the best part yet.

380
00:14:00,614 --> 00:14:03,373
他还载歌载舞 我当时真心看不下去了
So he's doing his little dance, and I can't take it anymore,

381
00:14:03,373 --> 00:14:05,593
就对准他开了洒水器
So I nail him with the sprinklers!

382
00:14:06,213 --> 00:14:08,323
是啊 你还把我的录放机搞短路了
Yep, and you also shorted out my boombox,

383
00:14:08,340 --> 00:14:09,900
你当时说会赔我一个 到现在也没影
which you said you'd replace and you never did.

384
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:11,200
我肯定没那样说过
I never said that!

385
00:14:11,220 --> 00:14:13,020
你真说过 你现在还欠我个录放机
Yes, you did. You still owe me one boombox,

386
00:14:13,140 --> 00:14:13,820
12节D型电池
12 "D" batteries,

387
00:14:13,862 --> 00:14:15,562
和一盒奥莉维亚·纽顿-约翰磁带
and an Olivia Newton-John cassingle.

388
00:14:16,351 --> 00:14:17,841
好吧 那...
Okay, uh...

389
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:19,920
我们在拳击场里解决这事吧
Why don't we settle it in the ring?

390
00:14:20,340 --> 00:14:21,420
我们去那较量
We get in there,

391
00:14:21,780 --> 00:14:24,500
如果你赢了 要什么录放机我都给你买
and if you beat me, I'll buy you any boombox you want.

392
00:14:24,780 --> 00:14:25,800
如果我赢了
If I beat you,

393
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:27,670
你就得在大家面前跳那舞
then you've gotta do your little dance for everyone.

394
00:14:30,180 --> 00:14:30,860
我应战
I'm in.

395
00:14:31,609 --> 00:14:32,959
我们"菲动"起来
Let's get Phil-sical.

396
00:14:34,409 --> 00:14:36,588
我一点都不担心 当海军时我打过拳击
I wasn't worried. I'd boxed in the navy.

397
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:38,260
而且对手是菲尔
And it was Phil.

398
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:40,280
我从没想到我会说这种话
And here's something I thought I'd never say--

399
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:44,480
我宁愿和我女婿打 也不愿和我"儿婿"打
I'd rather box my daughter's husband than my son's.

400
00:14:56,315 --> 00:14:59,475
或许对杰 我一直酝酿着一丝丝怒气
I may have been holding on to a tiny bit of anger towards Jay.

401
00:15:00,275 --> 00:15:03,374
我卖了整整一夏天的冰淇淋才买了那台录放机
I scooped ice cream all summer for that boombox!

402
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:12,000
不好意思 让一让 我们来了
Excuse me. Pardon me. We're here!

403
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:14,100
我们紧赶着到了
We came as fast as we could!

404
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:15,520
你就不能换身衣服吗
You couldn't change?

405
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:17,520
不是你说立马过来吗
You said come right away!

406
00:15:18,100 --> 00:15:19,900
打扰一下 女士们先生们
Excuse me, ladies and gentlemen!

407
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:21,740
奥克伍德剧院出品的音乐剧《猫》
Oakwood Rep's production of "Cats"!

408
00:15:22,340 --> 00:15:23,440
确保这周不要错过哦
Make sure you catch it this week.

409
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:26,560
小道消息都说替角儿在里面大出风头了呢
Word on the street is the understudy steals the show!

410
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:29,280
米奇尔 我又获得了两个表演机会
Mitchell, I get two more shows!

411
00:15:29,480 --> 00:15:31,480
多亏肯尼·范·海辛顿的脚趾甲感染了
Kenny Van Heffington's toenail is infected!

412
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:32,840
赶紧上来 好吗
Just get up here, all right?

413
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:34,250
工作人员天黑才走
The crew has to leave at dark,

414
00:15:34,340 --> 00:15:35,440
所以你得坚持到那时候
so you have until then.

415
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:37,300
小菜一碟
Easy peasy.

416
00:15:37,860 --> 00:15:40,000
宝贝 跟二爸说你觉得我的表演怎么样
Sweetie, tell daddy what you thought of my performance.

417
00:15:40,059 --> 00:15:41,558
出类拔萃
Transcendent.

418
00:15:41,558 --> 00:15:42,768
我的天
Oh, jeez.

419
00:15:43,060 --> 00:15:43,760
是树液吗
Is this sap?

420
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:49,200
我都买了几百美元的商品了
Why would I buy hundreds of dollars worth of merchandise

421
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:50,740
为什么还要偷件20美元的运动衫
and then steal a $20 sweatshirt?

422
00:15:51,100 --> 00:15:53,800
我不知道 或许你是要找刺激
I don't know. Maybe you do it for the thrill.

423
00:15:54,780 --> 00:15:55,580
你这类人我见得多了
I know your type.

424
00:15:55,820 --> 00:15:58,120
无聊的家庭主妇 开辆小面包
You're a bored housewife, drives a minivan,

425
00:15:58,280 --> 00:16:00,120
丈夫沉迷网络
husband spends a little too much time online.

426
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:02,780
有两个孩子 和一个派不上用场的大学文凭
Got a couple of kids, a college degree you don't use.

427
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:03,940
你错得太离谱了
You could not be more wrong.

428
00:16:04,340 --> 00:16:05,980
没错 她有仨孩子呢
Yes. She has three kids.

429
00:16:06,025 --> 00:16:06,985
行了 不 不用了
Okay, no. No, no.

430
00:16:06,985 --> 00:16:08,874
不 不 不用了 你别帮倒忙了
No, no. No, that's not helping.

431
00:16:09,380 --> 00:16:11,780
听着 我已经说过了 那纯属意外
Look, as I said before, it was an accident.

432
00:16:11,980 --> 00:16:13,700
你这种话我听过不下千遍了
Heard it a thousand times.

433
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:16,440
老奶奶 商人 资优生
Grandmothers, businessmen, honor students--

434
00:16:16,460 --> 00:16:17,920
他们都这么说
They all say the same thing--

435
00:16:18,220 --> 00:16:19,220
"那纯属意外
"It was an accident.

436
00:16:19,283 --> 00:16:20,442
我也不知道那个收音机闹钟
I don't know how that clock radio

437
00:16:20,442 --> 00:16:21,392
怎么到我裤子里来的"
got in my pants."

438
00:16:21,392 --> 00:16:23,452
看在上帝份上 我身体不舒服
Oh, for god sake! I don't feel well.

439
00:16:23,620 --> 00:16:24,380
让我们走吧
Let us go.

440
00:16:24,500 --> 00:16:25,160
想得美
Yeah, right.

441
00:16:25,780 --> 00:16:26,660
那真是个婴儿吗
Is that even a baby?

442
00:16:27,191 --> 00:16:29,501
因为从我这角度看过去 跟个火鸡似的
'Cause from here, it looks like a turkey.

443
00:16:30,820 --> 00:16:33,420
我要你在这上面签字 承认你有罪
I need you to sign this, admitting your guilt,

444
00:16:33,420 --> 00:16:34,940
保证再也不上我们商场来
and promising you'll never return to this store.

445
00:16:35,020 --> 00:16:36,160
我才不会签这字
I'm not signing that.

446
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:36,920
那好
Okay, great.

447
00:16:37,230 --> 00:16:38,830
那我就只能报警 被迫...
Then I'm gonna call the police and I'll be forced to--

448
00:16:39,700 --> 00:16:41,380
那是什么
What was that?

449
00:16:41,860 --> 00:16:43,060
我的羊水破了
My water broke!

450
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:45,100
我要生了
I'm having the baby!

451
00:16:51,340 --> 00:16:54,080
对不起 我刚才失控了
Sorry about that. I went a little nuts there.

452
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:54,840
不知道怎么会这样
I don't know what happened.

453
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:56,720
我知道
I do.

454
00:16:57,560 --> 00:16:59,580
我在你朋友面前大爆你的糗事
I was ragging on you in front of your friends.

455
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:01,800
-是哦 -对不起
- Oh, yeah. - Sorry about that.

456
00:17:02,300 --> 00:17:04,460
我想不到还能说些什么
I couldn't think of anything else to say.

457
00:17:05,060 --> 00:17:05,560
为什么
Why not?

458
00:17:05,726 --> 00:17:07,215
我跟他们有20到25年的代沟
I got 20, 25 years on those guys.

459
00:17:07,215 --> 00:17:08,395
没什么共同语言
We got nothing in common.

460
00:17:08,545 --> 00:17:09,845
而且情况只会更糟
It's only gonna get worse.

461
00:17:10,365 --> 00:17:12,584
想想看 10年后我和新宝宝相处会是什么状况
I mean, what's it gonna be like with the new kid in ten years?

462
00:17:12,900 --> 00:17:13,800
我的老天
Oh, my goodness.

463
00:17:15,460 --> 00:17:17,060
你缺乏安全感 脆弱无助
You're insecure and vulnerable.

464
00:17:17,180 --> 00:17:18,880
我从没见过你这么可爱的样子
This is the cutest thing I've ever seen.

465
00:17:19,180 --> 00:17:19,700
闭嘴
Shut up.

466
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:21,160
瞧这只害羞的兔兔
Who's a shy bunny?

467
00:17:21,413 --> 00:17:23,363
你想不戴手套再来一回合吗
You wanna go one more round, without the gloves?

468
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:25,040
开个玩笑嘛 杰
I'm just playing around, Jay.

469
00:17:25,540 --> 00:17:26,740
我不在乎你多大年纪
I don't care how old you are.

470
00:17:26,740 --> 00:17:27,980
我可以整天和你聊个没完
I could sit and talk to you all day.

471
00:17:28,780 --> 00:17:30,080
那些家伙也是真的喜欢你
Those guys really liked you, too.

472
00:17:30,080 --> 00:17:31,460
我才不在乎
I don't care about that.

473
00:17:32,540 --> 00:17:33,000
真的吗
Did they?

474
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:35,540
-连杰瑞都喜欢我 -是的
- Even Jerry? - Yes.

475
00:17:36,440 --> 00:17:37,280
也许你是对的
Well, maybe you're right.

476
00:17:38,320 --> 00:17:39,800
曼尼根本就不想来 你瞧他
I mean, Manny didn't want to come, and look at him.

477
00:17:40,020 --> 00:17:41,160
他看起来玩得非常开心
Looks like he's having a great time.

478
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:43,810
然后卢克的爸爸从我这里抢走了电击枪
So then Luke's dad grabs the taser from me,

479
00:17:43,810 --> 00:17:47,079
-然后他就这样 -不 不是
- and he was like, "Uhh! Uhh!" - No. No!

480
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:48,220
事情不是这样的
That's not how it happened.

481
00:17:52,768 --> 00:17:53,668
妈呀 好痛
Aah! Ay! Ay! It hurts!

482
00:17:53,668 --> 00:17:54,378
坚持下 坚持下
Hang in there! Hang in there!

483
00:17:54,580 --> 00:17:55,840
我会尽快送你去医院
Get you to the hospital as soon as I can!

484
00:17:55,980 --> 00:17:56,740
我代表超市
I just want to apologize...

485
00:17:56,740 --> 00:17:58,320
再次表达歉意
one more time on behalf of the store

486
00:17:58,320 --> 00:17:59,620
抱歉可能给你带来了压力
for any stress that I might have caused you.

487
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,100
给 这件运动衫就当作是礼物吧
Here, you can keep the sweatshirt as a gift.

488
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:03,140
恭喜你喜得贵子
And congratulations on this baby,

489
00:18:03,140 --> 00:18:05,140
很显然这不是火鸡 那只是...
which is clearly not a turkey. That was--

490
00:18:05,140 --> 00:18:07,200
-快滚开 -快走
- Go away now! - Yeah.

491
00:18:07,786 --> 00:18:10,776
快上车 快点
Okay. Go on. Go on. Get in. Keep going.

492
00:18:11,120 --> 00:18:12,240
我们要去哪家医院
What hospital are we going to?

493
00:18:12,305 --> 00:18:15,115
-不去医院 -不去医院 哇
- No! No hospital! - No hospital. Wow.

494
00:18:15,115 --> 00:18:16,505
你是在家生产的人啊
You're one of those, huh?

495
00:18:16,505 --> 00:18:18,254
好吧 请别在游泳池里生
Okay, please don't have it in the pool, though.

496
00:18:18,264 --> 00:18:19,574
我们还要游泳的
'cause we swim in there.

497
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:21,840
我还没到生的时候 克莱尔
I'm not having the baby, Claire.

498
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:23,220
我只是假装的
I was just faking it.

499
00:18:24,360 --> 00:18:24,620
什么
What?

500
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:28,680
怀孕的傻脑瓜还能转得这么快 不错吧
Not bad for someone with pregnancy brain, huh?

501
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:30,880
非常好 真是太好了
Okay, that's good. That was very good.

502
00:18:31,060 --> 00:18:32,060
脑子转得真快 歌洛莉亚
Good thinking, Gloria.

503
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:34,160
抱歉 我不能坐在那里
I'm sorry. I just couldn't sit there

504
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:35,060
眼巴巴地看着你
and watch you suffer

505
00:18:35,060 --> 00:18:37,040
就因为脑子停工了而遭罪
just because you had turned your brain off.

506
00:18:37,122 --> 00:18:38,641
好吧 是我活该
Okay, I deserved that.

507
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:41,460
不要 不要啊
Oh, no. Oh, no, no, no, no.

508
00:18:41,460 --> 00:18:43,260
我刚闯了个红灯 见鬼
I just blew through a red light. Damn.

509
00:18:43,910 --> 00:18:45,080
你可以再装下
You think you can keep the pregnancy thing up

510
00:18:45,220 --> 00:18:46,260
快生孩子了吗
for a little while longer?

511
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:50,020
头快出来了
I feel the head!

512
00:18:50,100 --> 00:18:51,520
出来了 出来了
Feel it! Feel it!

513
00:18:51,560 --> 00:18:53,540
等会儿 留着在警察面前装
Save it! Save it for the cop!

514
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:54,700
留着
Save it.

515
00:18:58,140 --> 00:19:00,460
好了伙计们 下班了 收工吧
All right, guys, that's it. Pack it up!

516
00:19:01,460 --> 00:19:03,940
今天算你狠 我们周一见
You win for today. See you on Monday.

517
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:05,840
就这样完了吗
That's it?

518
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:06,760
就这样完了
That's it.

519
00:19:06,900 --> 00:19:08,580
我周一会去市政厅
So I'll go to city hall on Monday

520
00:19:08,580 --> 00:19:09,600
看看有没有办法
and see what I can do,

521
00:19:09,600 --> 00:19:11,600
但是 你成功了 小卡
But... You did it, cam!

522
00:19:11,760 --> 00:19:12,860
不 我们成功了
No, we did it.

523
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:14,880
我有急事离开 你就挺身而出
I had to run away, and you stepped in,

524
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:17,460
就像替补演员 奉献了精彩的表演
and like an understudy, you gave a brilliant performance.

525
00:19:17,980 --> 00:19:19,700
但你才是明星
Yeah, but you're the star.

526
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:20,680
好吧
Oh, well...

527
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:24,560
可以不玩这个了回家吗
Can we stop doing this and go home?

528
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:27,200
好的 莉莉 但我希望你记住这一时刻
Yes, Lily, but I want you to remember this moment--

529
00:19:27,434 --> 00:19:29,683
你大爸二爸让你骄傲的一天
The day your daddies made you proud.

530
00:19:34,540 --> 00:19:36,520
别让她看 米奇尔 别让她看
Turn her away, Mitchell! Turn her away!

531
00:19:47,620 --> 00:19:49,680
艾丽克斯 你在这里做什么
Alex, what are you doing here?

532
00:19:49,680 --> 00:19:53,800
学习关于因果报应的宝贵一课
Learning a valuable lesson about karma

533
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:55,500
以及利用别人的糗事来取乐
and how wrong it is to take pleasure

534
00:19:55,500 --> 00:19:56,480
是非常错误的
in people's embarrassment.

535
00:19:57,280 --> 00:19:59,900
哇 我完全不懂你在说什么
Wow. I don't know what any of that means,

536
00:19:59,900 --> 00:20:01,440
不过你的样子好惨
but you look like hell.

537
00:20:02,540 --> 00:20:03,740
-说"呆子" -不
- Say "Geek." - No!

538
00:20:04,600 --> 00:20:05,880
他是个"破坏者"哦
He's a vandalizer!

539
00:20:09,947 --> 00:20:12,387
593个赞 人数继续上升中
593 likes, and counting.

540
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:19,280
这是谁家走失的小猫咪
Who does he belong to?

541
00:20:19,840 --> 00:20:20,860
我家的
He's mine.

542
00:20:22,440 --> 00:20:24,940
美妙的一天有了一个美妙的结局
It was a great ending to an amazing day.

543
00:20:25,100 --> 00:20:27,380
瞧 我甚至 上了报
Look, I even... Made the paper.

544
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:30,540
古怪抗议拯救公园树木
"Bizarre protest saves park tree."

545
00:20:31,034 --> 00:20:32,314
看这里写的
Oh, look what it says.

546
00:20:32,364 --> 00:20:33,834
本版音乐剧《猫》该永远不得面世
"This production of 'Cats' should be put to sleep."

547
00:20:34,200 --> 00:20:35,260
别看那个
Don't read that.

548
00:20:41,740 --> 00:20:41,920
别
Don't...

549
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:46,460
你好 歌洛莉亚
Oh, hey, Gloria.

550
00:20:46,662 --> 00:20:48,541
我打了电话给杰 借个电钻
Listen, I called Jay about borrowing a drill

551
00:20:48,541 --> 00:20:49,351
装抽屉柜的把手
for my dresser handles.

552
00:20:49,520 --> 00:20:50,660
我拿来了 小卡
I got it right here, Cam!

553
00:20:50,941 --> 00:20:52,591
老天 怎么穿成这样
Oh, jeez. What's with the getup?

554
00:20:52,800 --> 00:20:54,460
太好了 原来我没做梦
Ay, good. You see that, too?

555
00:20:55,540 --> 00:20:56,420
斯黛拉 别这样
Stella, stop.

556
00:20:56,830 --> 00:20:58,770
安静 抱歉 小卡
Ay, shh, shh, shh. Sorry, Cam.

557
00:20:58,820 --> 00:21:00,680
别这样 它这是在恭维我栩栩如生呢
Oh, no, don't be. I take it as a compliment.

558
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:05,640
《猫》 直到永恒
"Cats"--now and forever.

559
00:21:06,189 --> 00:21:07,778
事实上 只到下周四
Actually, just till next Thursday.

560
00:21:07,900 --> 00:21:09,660
演出被形容为"出类拔萃"
It's been described as "Transcendent."
